                    {
                        "form_id": "000c0743-65bc-47be-8c5e-6e2e43e22725",
                        "entry_id": "4672c8ea-8278-3be8-9f18-e583e9b9177c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "fascinatrices"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4952adc7-7bef-3030-a35a-aebeb206acd1",
                        "entry_id": "4672c8ea-8278-3be8-9f18-e583e9b9177c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui fascine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e4c9adf5-a6e2-42cf-98a8-21816ecacbc1",
                                "sense_id": "4952adc7-7bef-3030-a35a-aebeb206acd1",
                                "text": "Il parut en effet que le regard morne et sombre de Front-de-Bœuf exerçait une partie de cette puissance fascinatrice sur son malheureux captif."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b37eed9-3d54-46bb-aa7e-92e7c0f7a5f2",
                                "sense_id": "4952adc7-7bef-3030-a35a-aebeb206acd1",
                                "text": "Délicate et frêle, elle avait besoin de cet homme énergique, au regard fascinateur, au courage de lion, à la volonté de fer, pour la soutenir dans la vie et la sauvegarder de sa toute puissante protection."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "91d845f9-ed79-4765-b70a-8e536619db67",
                                "sense_id": "4952adc7-7bef-3030-a35a-aebeb206acd1",
                                "text": "Cette femme qu’on lui enlevait (car on la lui enlevait) acquit à ses yeux aussitôt des séductions fascinatrices."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e061830a-f0e6-4afb-b13e-1a14b7cbdc5d",
                                "sense_id": "4952adc7-7bef-3030-a35a-aebeb206acd1",
                                "text": "L’esprit rayonnait des yeux et donnait au visage de la beauté. Il avait conscience de sa force fascinatrice, comme il avait conscience de son génie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f412c58-72d5-4115-9ed9-9d825cc3e2ff",
                                "sense_id": "4952adc7-7bef-3030-a35a-aebeb206acd1",
                                "text": "C’est ainsi qu’il vit passer l’image de son lit fascinateur, c’est ainsi qu’il pensa qu’il pourrait très bien dîner seul."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "45a09f58-da58-4c7a-849c-a6a7613e3a2f",
                        "source_entry_id": "4672c8ea-8278-3be8-9f18-e583e9b9177c",
                        "source_sense_id": "4952adc7-7bef-3030-a35a-aebeb206acd1",
                        "target_lang_word": "fascinator",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fascinator",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1fb42674-bae8-3e03-9ca5-d0f2416bb399",
                                        "entry_id": "10c2f0cd-7c95-3684-a705-640f2fcfc303",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fascinating person or thing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68f206a7-82fb-4ee7-9778-0f9d13908544",
                                                "sense_id": "1fb42674-bae8-3e03-9ca5-d0f2416bb399",
                                                "text": "A more repellent personality would be hard to imagine, and yet Hedda Gabler is one of the eternal fascinators of the world stage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae150d84-05d7-3652-bcf0-2cb276eaf737",
                                        "entry_id": "10c2f0cd-7c95-3684-a705-640f2fcfc303",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A delicate, often frivolous head decoration worn on the hair, primarily by women."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ef7662e-519f-49e8-bcd6-a20181a8b624",
                                                "sense_id": "ae150d84-05d7-3652-bcf0-2cb276eaf737",
                                                "text": "Why, for example, was Lady Gaga the first act? Surrounded by pink ostrich feathers and wearing a fascinator that looked like a feather quill atop her head, she put on her best French accent to sing Mon truc en plumes (originally by Zizi Jeanmaire) but it still looked like a scrappy, tacky, riverbank cabaret by an American pop star."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86727380-6b20-4825-a261-330eee6eb1b7",
                                                "sense_id": "ae150d84-05d7-3652-bcf0-2cb276eaf737",
                                                "text": "Westminster Abbey was peppered with everything from neat pillbox hats to netted fascinators."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3182eec5-bbbc-4763-af59-edb5026b1a7d",
                                                "sense_id": "ae150d84-05d7-3652-bcf0-2cb276eaf737",
                                                "text": "On a recent night when I visited, a group of girls had taken over an entire section, all of them wearing black fascinators as if attending a funeral. The hostess explained that it was a young woman named Mallory’s “RIP to my 20s” birthday dinner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "acb18884-dcb3-32f2-a70e-89bebd99dd0f",
                                        "entry_id": "10c2f0cd-7c95-3684-a705-640f2fcfc303",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of wool or lace headscarf."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "59e0d4d1-0a36-3f90-bee1-fe1bec96dc17",
